      "value": "本条只写 StockCharts《Ease of Movement (EMV)》默认平滑核：1期EMV=DistanceMoved/BoxRatio，DistanceMoved=((H+L)/2−前中点)；BoxRatio=((V/1e8)/(H−L))；EMV14=SMA14(1期EMV)。收盘 **EMV14>0** → **SPY**，否则 **BIL**。不是1期未平滑。计入美股/ETF。提出日期 1990-01-01。"
